# Mosquitto ACL — SmarterHome Hub
# Place this file at: /etc/mosquitto/acls
# Reference it in smarthome.conf with: acl_file /etc/mosquitto/acls
#
# Each node can only read/write its own subtopic.
# The automation engine and dashboard clients get full access.

user esp32-living-room
topic readwrite smarthome/living_room/#

user esp32-bedroom
topic readwrite smarthome/bedroom/#

user esp32-kitchen
topic readwrite smarthome/kitchen/#

user esp32-entrance
topic readwrite smarthome/entrance/#

# Automation engine needs to read all sensor topics and write to action/alert topics
user smarthome-automation
topic readwrite smarthome/#

# Dashboard / mobile app — read all state, write only control topics
user smarthome-dashboard
topic read smarthome/#
topic write smarthome/+/light/+/set
topic write smarthome/+/ac/set
topic write smarthome/+/tv/set
topic write smarthome/entrance/door_lock/set
